{"id":69549,"date":"2025-11-06T03:18:48","date_gmt":"2025-11-06T02:18:48","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69549"},"modified":"2026-10-14T08:03:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-14T07:03:50","slug":"sao-silvestre-amares","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-amares\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Amares 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Amares 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>12\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Amares 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o no <strong>Largo Gualdim Pais<\/strong> em <strong>Amares<\/strong> e partidas a partir das <strong>17:00<\/strong>. O evento despede-se do ano desportivo ligando a vila de Amares \u00e0 vila termal de Caldelas num tra\u00e7ado citadino festivo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa inclui a <strong>Corrida competitiva de aproximadamente 9 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 17:00), a <strong>Caminhada de aproximadamente 9 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 17:05) e a <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre da Pequenada<\/strong> para o p\u00fablico infantil. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura gratuitamente o servi\u00e7o de transporte de agasalhos da partida para a meta e autocarros de transporte de regresso de Caldelas para Amares.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Gin\u00e1sio Pro-Energy by Amares ativa<\/strong> em conjunto com o CDRC Amarense e o Munic\u00edpio de Amares, contando com abastecimentos interm\u00e9dios e finais, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e 1.000 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os vencedores absolutos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: b